WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Dad, let me tell you something that comes from my heart.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Now that you have a public job,

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
That's people with a fixed income.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,540
what do you want to do

5
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:12,590
What is your attitude?

6
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:14,590
You are provided with food and accommodation in the bureau, right?

7
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:18,070
Then the room in the jar in my hometown will be vacant.

8
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:19,330
I've done the math

9
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:20,330
Your room has good lighting

10
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:23,330
If you rent it out, you can earn at least 800 yuan a month.

11
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:25,330
Since you don’t sleep on the bed standing up

12
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:26,330
Then have your glands folded

13
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:27,330
starting from this month

14
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:29,330
You were paid every month

15
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:30,330
Remember to give me half

16
00:00:30,330 --> 00:00:32,330
Count it as your rent at home

17
00:00:32,330 --> 00:00:38,200
and bedding storage fees

18
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:40,200
Half of the salary is used as rent

19
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,200
Why don't you and the others grab it?

20
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:43,200
Invite guest consultant Zhang Wei

21
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:45,200
Go to the Administrative Section on the second floor of Fu

22
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:46,200
Process formal onboarding

23
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:48,200
That is, the equipment collection procedure
